OL,3,GNEWSAFestivalgoers urged to book ahead
OL,4,Aby rail company
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn expected 65,000 revellers expected
OL,7,Fto use the train to get home from the
OL,8,FReading Festival should book ahead, a
OL,9,Frail operator has said.
OL,11,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) said the
OL,12,Fevent was its busiest of the year and
OL,13,Fencouraged people travelling back on
OL,14,FBank Holiday Monday to buy their ticket
OL,15,Fbefore they began their journey to cut
OL,16,Fwaiting times.
OL,18,FCharli XCX, rapper Dave and Chase &
OL,19,FStatus will headline the festival and
OL,20,Fits sister event in Leeds. About
OL,21,F100,000 people are expected in Reading
OL,22,Ffrom Thursday to Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
